---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About — DJ Welker"
  description="DJ Welker is a self-taught creative director, designer, and maker in York, PA — an operator, builder, and founder who works across brand, product, content, and operations."
  current="about"
>
<style slot="head">
.abgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:820px){.abgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.photostack{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.photostack .pmain{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.prow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.prow img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/4;object-fit:cover;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
</style>
<main id="main">

<header class="case-head"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="k">About · York, PA + remote</div>
  <h1>Operator, builder,<br>and founder.</h1>
  <p class="tag">Most people are one of the three. DJ Welker is all three — a self-taught creative director and maker who builds brands, tools, and systems, and runs real operations. Fast turnarounds, clean work, done right.</p>
</div></header>

<section class="csec"><div class="wrap abgrid">
  <div>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:14px">The short version</h2>
    <p>I'm DJ Welker, based in York, PA. I make brands, websites, and tools, and I run real operations. I take an unclear business, brand, or idea and turn it into something organized, attractive, and built to move — not just a logo, but the identity, the site, the content, the tools, and the operation behind it, designed to work together.</p>
    <p>I've never been able to sit still creatively. Instead of paying for college courses, I taught myself by doing — every brand, graphic, platform, and product in this portfolio was built through real work, trial, and reps. I run my own studio, CE OS, and my own ventures, and I take most projects from the first idea all the way to the finished product.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;margin:28px 0 14px">How I work</h2>
    <p>Diagnose what's actually disconnected. Design the system it needs. Build it. Connect it. Then keep improving it with real reporting. I'd rather show working proof than talk in abstractions — the work does the arguing. I came up in management and customer service, so I know operations from the ground up.</p>
    <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Open to design, brand, and build roles — full-time, contract, or fractional.</p>
    <div class="chips" style="margin-top:16px">
      <span class="c">Brand &amp; identity design</span><span class="c">Web &amp; software</span><span class="c">Digital products</span><span class="c">Automation &amp; AI</span><span class="c">Content &amp; campaigns</span><span class="c">E-commerce &amp; resale</span><span class="c">Operations</span><span class="c">DJing / music (CARBYN)</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="photostack">
      <img src="/assets/shots/dj-1.jpg" alt="DJ Welker, York PA" class="pmain" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="825" height="1100" />
      <div class="prow">
        <img src="/assets/shots/dj-2.jpg" alt="DJ Welker" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="825" height="1100" />
        <img src="/assets/shots/dj-3.jpg" alt="DJ Welker" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="825" height="1100" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">DJ Welker · York, PA · founder of CE OS &amp; Thrown After</p>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="csec"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:620px;margin-inline:auto">
  <h2>Open to the right role.</h2>
  <div style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn--accent" href="/contact">Get in touch <span class="ar">↗</span></a><a class="btn" href="/resume">See résumé</a></div>
</div></section>

</main>
<footer><div class="wrap">
  <div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;line-height:2;opacity:.85">
    <a href="mailto:ceodjwelker@gmail.com">ceodjwelker@gmail.com</a> · <a href="tel:+17178814960">(717) 881-4960</a> · <a href="https://instagram.com/dj.welker" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@dj.welker</a> · York, PA + remote
  </div>
</div></footer>

</Base>
